# obs-chain spec for shift2m (Z0 at (3,0,-1) facing south) in a 9x5x4 box (z -2..1).
# Left (rows 1-2): 0,2,5,7,9,12 + far puller RP7 14. Right (row 0): 0,3,7,10,13,15 + far
# puller LP0 16 (2 gt units; ideal/shift2m-lr.ideal validates these gaps). Cell parity = root
# parity + time. P0-shifted's driver must output INTO (3,1,0) (its update reaches (3,0,0)).
schedule designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/ground/ideal/shift2m.ideal
lever 1 3 -1 minecraft:lever[face=wall,facing=north,powered=false]
support 1 3 0 minecraft:stone
root 1 3 -2 south
box -3 0 -2 5 4 1
group P1H 0
opt -2 3 0 up
opt -2 2 -1 north
group Z2 2
opt -1 3 -1 up
opt -2 2 -1 west
group Q3 5
opt -3 3 0 up
opt -3 2 -1 north
group PS4 7
opt -1 3 0 up
group Q5 9
opt -3 3 0 up
opt -3 2 -1 north
group P6H 12
opt -2 3 0 up
opt -2 2 -1 north
group RP7 14
opt 4 2 -1 north
opt 4 3 0 up
group R1H 0
opt 4 0 -1 north
group RZ2 3
optb 3 1 -2 up 3 0 -2 minecraft:stone
group RQ3 7
opt 5 1 0 up
opt 5 0 -1 north
group RPS4 10
opt 3 1 -1 north
group RQ5 13
opt 5 1 0 up
opt 5 0 -1 north
group R6H 15
optb 4 1 1 up 4 0 1 minecraft:stone
group LP0 16
opt -2 0 -1 north
